xbx-nrf licensing
=================

Copyright (c) 2026 zuidec

This project uses different licences for different kinds of content. The full
licence texts are in LICENSES/. Per-path details are in REUSE.toml
(https://reuse.software).

  Firmware and scripts (firmware/, build scripts, config)   MIT
  Hardware design (pcb/, references/pcb-cad.*)             CERN-OHL-S-2.0
  Documentation (docs/, *.md)                              CC-BY-4.0

Exception:

  pcb/xbx-nrf/lib/RKJXV122400R/  SnapMagic CAD files, CC-BY-SA-4.0 with the
                                 SnapMagic Design Exception 1.0; see
                                 ATTRIBUTION.md in that folder.

Not included: references/third-party/ (git-ignored) holds third-party documents
that are not part of this project and not covered by its licences; see
references/README.md for their sources.
